Blood and Black Beach — Giallo Gouache (qianhuang)
LemoLab × Claude Opus 5.5

Picture: every line, wash, figure, colour field and letter is drawn by code in this folder
(engine.js, world.js, poses.js, film.js). No generated or third-party images, no stock footage.

Sound: the sfx bed is synthesised from scratch by voice/make_sfx.py (pure Python, wave + struct):
blade whoosh / shing / thud, splice transients, letter ticks, title boom, sand steps, sub drone.
Voice: recorded separately, not in this repo (voice/voice.wav is git-ignored).

